WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.360
A magnet, not a mirror.

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:03.210
Most ads mirror the category and look like everyone else.

00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:08.890
A magnet is distinctive enough to pull people in.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:10.400
On the TV, three ads in a row: real people being real people.

00:00:09.777 --> 00:00:16.646
The family can't tell which brand is which.

00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:18.828
That's the mirror test.

00:00:18.878 --> 00:00:22.825
Take a still, remove the logo, and put it beside three rivals.

00:00:22.875 --> 00:00:25.963
If nobody can pick yours, it's a mirror.

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:27.855
Use it like this:

00:00:27.905 --> 00:00:28.705
run the test on the brand's ads,

00:00:28.153 --> 00:00:33.393
then pitch a distinctive direction tied to its positioning.
